      "stem_html": "<p>Oft er hægt að búa til etra með S<sub>N</sub>2-efnahvarfi alkoxíðjóna, RO<sup>–</sup>, við alkýlhalíð. Segjum að þú viljir búa til sýklóhexýlmetýletra. Hvora af eftirfarandi tveimur mögulegum leiðum myndir þú velja? Útskýrðu.</p>\n<img class=\"scaled-down\" src=\"https://exercises.openstax.org/rails/active_storage/blobs/proxy/eyJfcmFpbHMiOnsibWVzc2FnZSI6IkJBaHBBdkFUIiwiZXhwIjpudWxsLCJwdXIiOiJibG9iX2lkIn19--f45be549356128f48303ab22fb8f8de5a884d9a5/OChem_11_EC_034.jpg\" alt=\"An illustration shows two reactions that yield cyclohexyl methyl ether as product. In the first reaction  an alkoxide ion reacts with iodomethane. The alkoxide ion shows a cyclo-hexane bonded to an oxygen anion. In the second reaction  iodobenzene reacts with methoxy anion (CH3 O minus). Cyclohexyl methyl ether shows a cyclohexane bonded to a methoxy group.\">",
